# Quick Add from the Today view with "today" in the text adds to INBOX and the new task joins the view.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
Work:
	- Report @due({today})
END
keys gt
see 󰖙 Today
keys q
type Buy stamps today
keys <Enter>
see - Buy stamps  INBOX
see 󰖙 Today
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
	- Buy stamps @start({today})
Work:
	- Report @due({today})
END
